    {"@id":"tkos:AttributedAssertion","@type":"owl:Class","rdfs:subClassOf":[{"@id":"tkos:ContextAsset"},{"@id":"tkos:DecisionProvenanceEntity"}],"rdfs:comment":{"@value":"带有表达或确认主体、来源与时间的主张。用于保存明确表达的判断，并与系统推断区分。","@language":"zh"},"rdfs:label":{"@value":"归属断言","@language":"zh"}},
    {"@id":"tkos:DecisionRecord","@type":"owl:Class","rdfs:subClassOf":{"@id":"tkos:DecisionProvenanceEntity"},"rdfs:comment":{"@value":"真实发生的决策事件记录，连接决策主体、输入、选择、确认与时间。","@language":"zh"},"rdfs:label":{"@value":"决策记录","@language":"zh"}},
