    {"@id":"tkos:DecisionProfileView","@type":"owl:Class","rdfs:subClassOf":[{"@id":"tkos:ContextAsset"},{"@id":"tkos:DecisionProvenanceEntity"}],"rdfs:comment":{"@value":"由当前有效的归属断言、决策记录与决策学习生成的可撤销、可重算视图，不作为人员稳定事实。","@language":"zh"},"rdfs:label":{"@value":"决策画像视图","@language":"zh"}},
    {"@id":"tkos:EvidenceSupport","@type":"owl:Class","rdfs:subClassOf":{"@id":"tkos:DecisionProvenanceEntity"},"rdfs:comment":{"@value":"将证据与其支持的主张或验收标准连接，并记录范围、强度、来源和时间的关系对象。","@language":"zh"},"rdfs:label":{"@value":"证据支持关系","@language":"zh"}},
